class.description:
Returned in [code]XboxResult.data[/code] by [method XboxNetworking.query_security_information_for_url_async]. Wraps the native [code]XNetworkingSecurityInformation[/code] record: the HTTP security protocols enabled for the URL, plus the certificate thumbprints a title can pin against.
The wrapper owns the native result buffer for its whole lifetime, because the native record's pointers point into it, and parses the contents into Godot types up front.
[codeblock]
var result: XboxResult = await GDK.networking.query_security_information_for_url_async("https://api.example.com")
if result.is_ok():
    var info: XboxNetworkingSecurityInformation = result.data
    for thumbprint in info.get_thumbprints():
        print(thumbprint["type_name"], ": ", thumbprint["hex"])
[/codeblock]
